# Build context of the client image of the Compose demonstration
# (`docker/compose.example.yml`, `docker/client/Dockerfile`).
#
# The context is `clients/python` because the root `.dockerignore` excludes
# `clients/`: it is not weakened for the demo. Like the root file, this one
# never lets a secret travel to the builder (ADR-0032), and it keeps the local
# virtual environment, the caches and the tests out of the image.
.env*
.venv/
__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
tests/
*.pyc
